<title>CHINA: SHENZHEN B INDEX ENDS HIGHER ON CHANGAN.</title>
<headline>SHENZHEN B INDEX ENDS HIGHER ON CHANGAN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shenzhen's hard currency B share index edged up slightly at the close on Tuesday, with a late afternoon burst of buying of Chongqing Chang'an Automobile Co Ltd, brokers said.</p>
<p>The B index rose 0.36 points or 0.27 percent to 133.25 on turnover of HK$59 million, against Monday's HK$44 million.</p>
